        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p>The rules governing registration, subscriptions, authorised access, and use of the EduCore web and Android school-management platform.</p>
    </div>
</header>

<main class="container legal-layout">
    <aside class="toc" aria-label="Terms of service contents">
